   "name": "Arakalagudu Biodigester Project II",
   "description": "The project is to install a 2 cubic meter bio gas generation per day capacity   biodigester for around 1000 house holds in Arakalagudu taluk of Hassan   District, Karnataka State, India.  The bio digester unit will treat animal manure in   anaerobic condition and produce bio gas which will replace the traditional   inefficient firewood waste cook stove.  In door air pollution can be avoided by   using clean biogas stove.      This project is being carried out by SKG Sangha, India.",
